The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a new [[Stardew:Carpenter's Shop#Farm Buildings|Farm Building]] that can be purchased from [[Stardew:Carpenter's Shop|Robin]] at the Carpenter's Shop, once players have shipped 500 bottles of [[Stardew:Wine|wine]]. 

External building colors can be changed by utilizing Robin's [[Stardew:Carpenter's_Shop#Painting|construction menu]]. 

==Construction==
Construction requires the following materials and takes Robin 7 days to complete.
* {{Price|500000}}
* {{NameSDV|Keg|30|size=22}}
* {{NameSDV|Hardwood|200}}
* {{NameSDV|Iridium Bar|25}}

==Features==
[[Stardew:Cask|Casks]] placed in the Winery will produce 15% faster.

